      "result": "QA validation complete — all 15 checklist items tested and recorded (10 PASS, 5 FAIL).\n\n**Summary of failures found:**\n- **FT-8**: Modify dialog lacks a date field — only time and party size can be changed, not the date.\n- **CS-10**: Reviews can be submitted for any restaurant with no check for a completed reservation, and no per-reservation review limit.\n- **CS-11**: The \"first-reservation\" WELCOME10 coupon rule isn't enforced — it was successfully applied a second time for the same guest.\n- **CS-13**: Invalid/missing reservation fields are silently rejected with zero user-facing feedback (no toast, no inline error, no field highlighting).\n- **CT-17**: After submitting a review, the restaurant's rating updates on the detail page but the home page restaurant list keeps a stale rating, and the review count didn't increment correctly, suggesting a dropped review.\n\n**Passing:** FT-1 through FT-7 (except FT-8), IX-14, IX-15, CT-16.",
